---
source: src/domain/uri.rs
expression: "messages.join(\"\\n\")"
---
"spotify.com" => expected kind:key, e.g. domain:spotify.com
":apple.com" => expected kind:key, e.g. domain:spotify.com
"stocks:AAPL" => unknown kind, expected one of: domain, airline, sports
"domain:" => invalid domain key: must not be empty
"airline:DAL" => invalid airline key: must be a two-character IATA code with at least one ASCII letter and at most one digit
"sports:nfl" => invalid sports key: must be league:team
